This weeks video is just a bit of fun and is NOT to be taken seriously. We are Marvel fans and with the new Thor movie coming soon, we thought we'd mess around with lights and silly efffects and came up with this. 

Thje ice cream is actually a Fig & Honey ice cream but with added effects. It's also got white chocolate shapes scattered throughout and on top for decoration. 

Overall, this actually turned out to be a pretty decent ice cream combo. The fig comes through well and the flavour builds over time. The honey ice cream is nice and sweet but don't substitute too much honey otherwise it'll be way too sweet. 
